Description: A reproducible frequentist Network Meta-Analysis (NMA)
    workflow in R demonstrating multi-treatment evidence synthesis using
    simulated benchmark data. Implements modular R scripts utilizing the
    netmeta package for model fitting, consistency diagnostics, treatment
    rankings, and publication-ready visualizations.
